# Custom merge driver for the size-guardrail caps file. Parallel in-flight PRs
# routinely each bump a cap in this one shared JSON, producing textual conflicts
# whose intent never actually conflicts (policy only ever raises caps). The
# `sizecap` driver performs a max-cap union merge so those conflicts auto-resolve.
#
# A .gitattributes entry alone does NOT activate the driver — git requires the
# `merge.sizecap.driver` command to be registered in the repo's local git config,
# which a clone does not carry. The agent's workspace-prep step installs that
# config (registerSizeCapMergeDriver). See backend/testing/merge_size_limits.py.
backend/testing/module_size_limits.json merge=sizecap
